# haydn device XNU patch series.
#
# 0001: SM8350 runs the HLOS under QHEE with CNTHCTL_EL2.EL1PCEN clear, so the
# physical timer registers are trapped and XNU arm_init faulted on its
# CNTP_CTL_EL0 write before any console existed.
# 0002: the SoC debug UART is a GENI block at 0x0098C000; give the kernel a
# kprintf path over it so bring-up is never blind again.
# 0003: panic_spin_forever spins on WFE after a panic and needs a manual power
# hold (no PMGR to drive the watchdog). Issue a PSCI SYSTEM_RESET SMC instead so
# a kernel panic reboots by itself; panic-psci-reset=0 disables it.
0001-sm8350-el1pcen-physical-timer.patch
0002-sm8350-geni-uart-console.patch
0003-sm8350-panic-psci-reset.patch
0004-sm8350-framebuffer-console.patch
